  Files:   tts/src/en_gold.tsv and tts/src/en_silver.tsv (generated from
           misaki's data by tools/tts/); tts/tests/misaki_en.tsv (misaki's
           output); tts::en is a Rust port of misaki's G2P
  Source:  https://github.com/hexgrad/misaki
  Licence: Apache-2.0
  Provenance: upstream does not document the sources of the gold
           dictionary. The silver dictionary is espeak-ng (GPL-3.0) output
